         </a>
       </div>
     </header>

     <main id="maincontent" tabindex="-1">
       <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
         <div class="hero-copy">
           <p class="eyebrow">New season essentials</p>
           <h1 id="hero-heading">Elevated retail finds for nights in, days out, and every city mile.</h1>
           <p>
             Discover tactile layers, sculptural home accents, and limited-run accessories curated for a
