           <div class="hero-stat-grid">
             <span><strong>48h</strong> early access</span>
             <span><strong>22</strong> new arrivals</span>
             <span><strong>15%</strong> member credit</span>
           </div>
         </div>
       </section>

       <section class="section" id="featured" aria-labelledby="featured-heading">
         <div class="section-heading">
           <div>
             <p class="eyebrow">Featured products</p>
             <h2 id="featured-heading">Most-wanted this week</h2>
           </div>
           <a class="text-link" href="#featured-grid">View all featured products</a>
         </div>

         <ul class="product-grid" id="featured-grid">
           <li>
             <article class="product-card">
               <div class="product-art product-art-coat" aria-hidden="true"></div>
               <div class="product-card-body">
                 <p class="product-meta">Outerwear</p>
                 <h3><a href="/products/obsidian-shell-jacket">Obsidian Shell Jacket</a></h3>
                 <p>Matte waterproof layer with a packable hood and brushed lining.</p>
                 <div class="product-purchase">
                   <span class="price">$188</span>
                   <button type="button" class="button button-small add-to-cart" data-product="Obsidian Shell Jacket">
                     Add to bag
                   </button>
                 </div>
               </div>
             </article>
           </li>
           <li>
             <article class="product-card">
               <div class="product-art product-art-lamp" aria-hidden="true"></div>
               <div class="product-card-body">
                 <p class="product-meta">Home</p>
                 <h3><a href="/products/smoked-glass-table-lamp">Smoked Glass Table Lamp</a></h3>
                 <p>Hand-finished amber glow with a low-profile dimmer base.</p>
                 <div class="product-purchase">
                   <span class="price">$124</span>
                   <button type="button" class="button button-small add-to-cart" data-product="Smoked Glass Table Lamp">
                     Add to bag
                   </button>
                 </div>
               </div>
             </article>
           </li>
           <li>
             <article class="product-card">
               <div class="product-art product-art-bag" aria-hidden="true"></div>
               <div class="product-card-body">
                 <p class="product-meta">Accessories</p>
                 <h3><a href="/products/arc-carryall-tote">Arc Carryall Tote</a></h3>
                 <p>Structured vegan leather tote with a laptop sleeve and key leash.</p>
                 <div class="product-purchase">
                   <span class="price">$96</span>
                   <button type="button" class="button button-small add-to-cart" data-product="Arc Carryall Tote">
                     Add to bag
                   </button>
                 </div>
               </div>
             </article>
           </li>
         </ul>
       </section>

       <section class="section deals-section" id="deals" aria-labelledby="deals-heading">
         <div class="section-heading">
           <div>
             <p class="eyebrow">Deals</p>
             <h2 id="deals-heading">Limited-time offers</h2>
           </div>
           <p class="section-note">Prices shown before member credits. Deals end Sunday.</p>
         </div>

         <div class="deals-grid">
           <article class="deal-card deal-card-featured">
             <div>
               <p class="deal-badge">Bundle save</p>
               <h3>City Layering Set</h3>
               <p>Choose a merino base, technical overshirt, and ribbed beanie for one sharp winter kit.</p>
             </div>
             <div class="deal-footer">
               <p><span class="deal-price">$142</span> <span class="deal-was">was $210</span></p>
               <button type="button" class="button button-primary add-to-cart" data-product="City Layering Set">
                 Add bundle
               </button>
             </div>
           </article>

           <article class="deal-card">
             <p class="deal-badge">30% off</p>
             <h3>Charcoal Ceramic Serveware</h3>
             <p>Deep-glaze bowls and coupe plates for moody hosting moments.</p>
             <a class="text-link" href="/collections/charcoal-ceramics">Shop serveware</a>
